{"id":"anfu_hrer","lemma":"Anführer","pos":"noun","rank":1636,"glosses":["leader, head, chief, commander; person in charge of a group or organisation","instructor"],"ipa":"/ˈan.fyːrɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/De-Anf%C3%BChrer.ogg/De-Anf%C3%BChrer.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Anführers","plural":"Anführer"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin einer der Anführer.","en":"I'm one of the leaders.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Er war der Anführer der Bewegung.","en":"He was the leader of the movement.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"motion"}]},{"text":"Sie sind der Anführer.","en":"You're the leader.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Unser Anführer weiß, was zu tun ist.","en":"Our leader will know what to do.","words":[{"g":"our"},null,{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Er besaß alle Eigenschaften eines Anführers.","en":"He had all the attributes of a leader.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to own, to possess","l":"besitzen"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"feature","l":"Eigenschaft"},{"g":"a, an","l":"ein"},null]}]}